### 200 Загрузка TXT файла из сервиса
POST {{host}}/api/internal/files/upload_file
Authorization: Basic {{basicAuth}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="entity_type"

SYSTEM_UPLOAD
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test_document.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

test file content
--WebAppBoundary--
